"information on available handler classes, see "
"the :class:`~django.utils.log.AdminEmailHandler` provided by Django and the "
"various :mod:`handler classes <logging.handlers>` provided by Python."
msgstr ""
"Olika handlerklasser har olika konfigurationsalternativ. Mer information om "
"tillgängliga handlerklasser finns "
"i :class:`~django.utils.log.AdminEmailHandler` från Django och de "
"olika :mod:`handlerklasser <logging.handlers>` som Python tillhandahåller."

msgid ""
"Logging levels can also be set on the handlers (by default, they accept log "
"messages of all levels). Using the example above, adding:"
msgstr ""
"Loggningsnivåer kan också ställas in för hanterarna (som standard accepterar "
