":func:`.mail.get_connection` and the ``connection`` arguments to mail "
"functions"
msgstr ""
":func:`.mail.get_connection` och argumentet ``connection`` till e-"
"postfunktioner"

msgid ""
"The ``fail_silently`` argument "
"to :func:`.send_mail`, :func:`.send_mass_mail`, :func:`.mail_admins`, :func:`.mail_managers`, "
"and :meth:`.EmailMessage.send`"
