"definierar du en :setting:`MAILERS`-ordbok med en post ``\"default\"`` som "
"motsvarar de tidigare inställningarna ``EMAIL_*``::"

msgid "For example, to update these settings::"
msgstr "För att till exempel uppdatera dessa inställningar::"

msgid "use::"
msgstr "använder du::"

msgid ""
"The complete list of deprecated ``EMAIL_*`` settings and where they should "
"be moved in a :setting:`MAILERS` configuration is:"
msgstr ""
"Den fullständiga listan över utfasade inställningar ``EMAIL_*`` och vart de "
"ska flyttas i en :setting:`MAILERS`-konfiguration är:"

msgid ""
":setting:`EMAIL_BACKEND` becomes ``\"BACKEND\"``. If your settings didn't "
"define :setting:`!EMAIL_BACKEND`, the default value was "
"``\"django.core.mail.backends.smtp.EmailBackend\"`` (which is also the "
"default if a :setting:`MAILERS` configuration doesn't specify the "
"``\"BACKEND\"``)."
msgstr ""
":setting:`EMAIL_BACKEND` blir ``\"BACKEND\"``. Om inställningarna inte "
"definierade :setting:`!EMAIL_BACKEND` var standardvärdet "
"``\"django.core.mail.backends.smtp.EmailBackend\"`` (vilket också är "
"standard om en :setting:`MAILERS`-konfiguration inte anger ``\"BACKEND\"``)."

msgid ""
":setting:`EMAIL_FILE_PATH` becomes ``\"file_path\"`` in ``\"OPTIONS\"`` "
"(with ``\"BACKEND\"`` set to "
"``\"django.core.mail.backends.filebased.EmailBackend\"``)."
msgstr ""
":setting:`EMAIL_FILE_PATH` blir ``\"file_path\"`` i ``\"OPTIONS\"`` (med "
"``\"BACKEND\"`` inställt på "
"``\"django.core.mail.backends.filebased.EmailBackend\"``)."

msgid ""
":setting:`EMAIL_HOST` becomes ``\"host\"`` in ``\"OPTIONS\"``. A "
"``\"host\"`` is required for the SMTP email backend. If your settings didn't "
"define ``EMAIL_HOST``, set ``\"host\"`` to ``\"localhost\"`` (the default "
"value for the deprecated setting)."
msgstr ""
":setting:`EMAIL_HOST` blir ``\"host\"`` i ``\"OPTIONS\"``. En ``\"host\"`` "
"krävs för SMTP-e-postbackend. Om inställningarna inte definierade "
"``EMAIL_HOST`` anger du ``\"host\"`` som ``\"localhost\"`` (standardvärdet "
"för den utfasade inställningen)."

msgid ""
":setting:`EMAIL_HOST_PASSWORD` becomes ``\"password\"`` in ``\"OPTIONS\"``."
msgstr ""
":setting:`EMAIL_HOST_PASSWORD` blir ``\"password\"`` i ``\"OPTIONS\"``."

msgid ""
":setting:`EMAIL_HOST_USER` becomes ``\"username\"`` in ``\"OPTIONS\"``. "
"(Note ``\"username\"`` doesn't quite follow the naming pattern for the other "
"deprecated settings.)"
msgstr ""
":setting:`EMAIL_HOST_USER` blir ``\"username\"`` i ``\"OPTIONS\"``. "
"(Observera att ``\"username\"`` inte helt följer namnkonventionen för de "
"andra utfasade inställningarna.)"

msgid ""
":setting:`EMAIL_PORT` becomes ``\"port\"`` in ``\"OPTIONS\"``. It can be "
"omitted if the connection uses the default port for its security (465 for "
"SSL, 587 for TLS, or 25 for an unsecured SMTP connection)."
msgstr ""
":setting:`EMAIL_PORT` blir ``\"port\"`` i ``\"OPTIONS\"``. Det kan utelämnas "
"om anslutningen använder standardporten för sin säkerhet (465 för SSL, 587 "
"för TLS eller 25 för en oskyddad SMTP-anslutning)."

msgid ""
":setting:`EMAIL_SSL_CERTFILE` becomes ``\"ssl_certfile\"`` in "
"``\"OPTIONS\"``."
msgstr ""
":setting:`EMAIL_SSL_CERTFILE` blir ``\"ssl_certfile\"`` i ``\"OPTIONS\"``."

msgid ""
":setting:`EMAIL_SSL_KEYFILE` becomes ``\"ssl_keyfile\"`` in ``\"OPTIONS\"``."
msgstr ""
":setting:`EMAIL_SSL_KEYFILE` blir ``\"ssl_keyfile\"`` i ``\"OPTIONS\"``."

msgid ":setting:`EMAIL_TIMEOUT` becomes ``\"timeout\"`` in ``\"OPTIONS\"``."
msgstr ":setting:`EMAIL_TIMEOUT` blir ``\"timeout\"`` i ``\"OPTIONS\"``."

msgid ":setting:`EMAIL_USE_SSL` becomes ``\"use_ssl\"`` in ``\"OPTIONS\"``."
msgstr ":setting:`EMAIL_USE_SSL` blir ``\"use_ssl\"`` i ``\"OPTIONS\"``."

msgid ":setting:`EMAIL_USE_TLS` becomes ``\"use_tls\"`` in ``\"OPTIONS\"``."
msgstr ":setting:`EMAIL_USE_TLS` blir ``\"use_tls\"`` i ``\"OPTIONS\"``."

msgid ""
"For third-party or custom email backends, the available ``\"OPTIONS\"`` "
"depend on the backend. Refer to the third-party documentation, or for custom "
"backends see :ref:`migrating-to-mailers-email-backends` below."
msgstr ""
"För tredjeparts- eller anpassade e-postbackendar beror tillgängliga "
"``\"OPTIONS\"`` på backend. Se dokumentationen från tredje part, eller för "
"anpassade backendar :ref:`migrating-to-mailers-email-backends` nedan."

msgid ""
"The :ref:`topic-email-configuration` topic has more information on the "
"``MAILERS`` setting and additional configuration examples."
msgstr ""
"Avsnittet :ref:`topic-email-configuration` innehåller mer information om "
"inställningen ``MAILERS`` och ytterligare konfigurationsexempel."

msgid "Reusable library readiness"
msgstr "Förbereda återanvändbara bibliotek"

msgid ""
"In most cases, third-party packages that send email through Django will "
"continue working with projects whose settings have been upgraded to "
"use :setting:`MAILERS`. (If they use any deprecated mail features, those "
"will of course cause deprecation warnings.)"
msgstr ""
"I de flesta fall fortsätter tredjepartspaket som skickar e-post via Django "
"att fungera med projekt vars inställningar har uppgraderats för att "
"använda :setting:`MAILERS`. (Om de använder utfasade e-postfunktioner kommer "
"dessa förstås att ge utfasningsvarningar.)"

msgid ""
"There are two deprecated features that are *not* supported "
"when :setting:`MAILERS` is defined in a project's settings:"
msgstr ""
"Det finns två utfasade funktioner som *inte* stöds när :setting:`MAILERS` "
"har definierats i ett projekts inställningar:"

msgid ""
"Trying to access any of the deprecated ``EMAIL_*`` settings on "
"``django.conf.settings`` (e.g., checking ``settings.EMAIL_BACKEND`` or using "
"``settings.EMAIL_HOST_USER``)."
msgstr ""
"Att försöka komma åt någon av de utfasade inställningarna ``EMAIL_*`` i "
"``django.conf.settings`` (till exempel att kontrollera "
"``settings.EMAIL_BACKEND`` eller använda ``settings.EMAIL_HOST_USER``)."

msgid ""
"Calling :func:`mail.get_connection(\"path.to.EmailBackend\") "
"<.mail.get_connection>` with a specific backend path. (Other arguments to "
"``get_connection()`` are still supported, and will simply issue deprecation "
"warnings when :setting:`MAILERS` is defined.)"
msgstr ""
"Att anropa :func:`mail.get_connection(\"path.to.EmailBackend\") "
"<.mail.get_connection>` med en specifik backend-sökväg. (Andra argument till "
"``get_connection()`` stöds fortfarande och ger bara utfasningsvarningar "
"när :setting:`MAILERS` är definierat.)"

msgid ""
"If a third-party package does either of those, projects that use it will not "
"be able to change to the :setting:`MAILERS` setting until the package has "
"been updated."
msgstr ""
"Om ett tredjepartspaket gör något av detta kommer projekt som använder det "
"inte att kunna byta till inställningen :setting:`MAILERS` förrän paketet har "
"uppdaterats."

msgid "Solving \"not available when MAILERS is defined\" errors"
msgstr "Åtgärda fel av typen \"not available when MAILERS is defined\""

msgid ""
"If either of these errors are raised within a third-party package, that "
"indicates it is not compatible with the :setting:`MAILERS` setting:"
msgstr ""
"Om något av dessa fel uppstår i ett tredjepartspaket betyder det att paketet "
"inte är kompatibelt med inställningen :setting:`MAILERS`:"

msgid ""
":samp:`AttributeError: \"The {name} setting is not available when MAILERS is "
"defined\"` where *name* is :setting:`EMAIL_BACKEND`, :setting:`EMAIL_HOST`, "
"or one of the other deprecated settings."
msgstr ""
":samp:`AttributeError: \"The {name} setting is not available when MAILERS is "
"defined\"` där *name* är :setting:`EMAIL_BACKEND`, :setting:`EMAIL_HOST` "
"eller någon annan av de utfasade inställningarna."

msgid ""
"``RuntimeError: get_connection(backend, ...) is not supported with MAILERS.``"
msgstr ""
"``RuntimeError: get_connection(backend, ...) is not supported with MAILERS.``"

msgid ""
"If you see these errors, check if a newer version of that dependency is "
"available. If not (and if there are no alternatives to that package), you "
"will need to remove :setting:`MAILERS` from your settings and replace it "
"with the equivalent :ref:`deprecated email settings <deprecated-email-"
"settings>` until the package has been updated."
msgstr ""
"Om du ser dessa fel, kontrollera om det finns en nyare version av beroendet. "
"Om det inte finns det (och det inte finns något alternativ till paketet) "
"behöver du ta bort :setting:`MAILERS` från inställningarna och ersätta den "
"med motsvarande :ref:`utfasade e-postinställningar <deprecated-email-"
"settings>` tills paketet har uppdaterats."

msgid ""
"If those errors are coming from your own code, see the other sections in "
"this migration guide for recommended updates."
msgstr ""
"Om felen kommer från din egen kod kan du läsa de andra avsnitten i denna "
"migreringsguide för rekommenderade uppdateringar."

